# BitcoinLink Environment Variables
# ================================
#
# This app uses pure Nostr architecture - NO environment variables required!
#
# The app connects to public Nostr relays:
#   - wss://relay.damus.io
#   - wss://relay.nostr.band
#   - wss://nos.lol
#   - wss://nostr.mutinywallet.com
#
# To customize relays, edit: src/lib/nostr/relays.ts

# No DATABASE_URL needed - data stored on Nostr relays
# No API keys needed - all client-side
# No secrets needed - encryption handled by NIP-17/NIP-44
